    "open_questions": [
      "His own books, Funk Drumming (Hal Leonard, 2005) and The Post-Bop Drum Book (2020), were not read; the patterns follow other transcribers, not him.",
      "Actual Proof beyond the intro: Inner Motion Music's transcription of bars 1 to 32 is too small at 1080p to read bar by bar, and the solos have no human transcription found.",
      "Butterfly and Palm Grease's variations of the head: no human transcription of Butterfly found (its Songsterr tabs are machine-made), and the Palm Grease tabs write no ghosts.",
      "Which kit he played on Thrust: not named in any source read.",
      "God Make Me Funky beyond measure 6: Hein's full transcription is an image that did not load; his breaks in red are not here."
    ]
